    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「…………」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あの。転校生さん、足長おじさんってご存知ですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わわっ、どうしたんですか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「本を落としちゃ駄目ですよ、大事に扱ってください！　うう～っ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「顔色、よくないですよ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「えっと、転校生さんはＢ組の子たちと『お泊まり会』っていうのしてたんでしたっけ……？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「それが、大変だったんですか？　寝不足だったりとか？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「そうですか～、わたしもここのところ寝不足だったんです。一緒ですね、えへへ♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「転校生さんはいつも、いろんな子のお手伝いとかしてて偉いなぁ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたし、自分のことだけで『いっぱいいっぱい』です」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「尊敬しちゃいます。転校生さんって、まるで足長おじさんみたい♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/surprise",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「どど、どうしたんですか？　ふらついてますよ、ちゃんと寝たほうがいいですよ～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あれなら、文芸部の部室にきます？　〆切前に泊まりこんだりするから、寝袋とかあるんですよ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「そこで休んでもらっていいです、本を運んでくれたお礼に～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「あっ、本が落ちた拍子にお手紙まで……。大事なものだもん、ちゃんと本に挟まないと。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「よいしょ、っと♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「えへへ、足長おじさんへの手紙なんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「本に挟んだお手紙で、足長おじさんってひとと文通してるんですよ～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたし、その足長おじさんの正体は部長なんじゃないか……って、疑ってるんです。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「本人に、ちゃんと確かめたことはないですけど」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「足長おじさんからのお手紙の文字が、部長が原稿用紙とかに手書きで残した文字と『そっくり』なんです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたしの目は誤魔化せませんよ、部長の原稿はたくさん読み直してるもん♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「何で文通みたいなことして、遠回しにコミュニケーションをとってくるのかわかんないんですけど。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「わたしとお話ししたいなら、ふつうに部室にくればいいのに」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「でも、文通でよかったかもしれません。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「部長と直接会っちゃうと、わたし、憎まれ口ばっかり叩いちゃうから」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「でもお手紙だと、不思議と素直になれるんです～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「それに、部長は生徒会のお仕事が忙しいですからね……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「お手紙に返事をしてくれるだけで、『もったいない』ぐらいです」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 35,
    "dress": "old-default",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-default_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -14,
      "y": 440
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "あいか",
    "text": "「それに、部長がちゃんとわたしのこと考えてくれてる、悩みの相談にものってくれる。」"
